  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.3 expands FormulaEngineer to 435 Excel-compatible functions and special forms, including modern dynamic-array and lambda-helper support such as LET, LAMBDA, MAP, REDUCE, SCAN, BYROW, BYCOL, MAKEARRAY, ISOMITTED, HSTACK, VSTACK, WRAPCOLS, WRAPROWS, TOCOL, TOROW, TAKE, DROP, EXPAND, RANDARRAY, SORTBY, ARABIC, ROMAN, and expanded statistical functions.",
